Limousine Hearse in Kenya","VIP Hearse","Executive Hearse","Executive Hearse in Kenya","Premium Hearse"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Our extended limousine hearse and matching family limousines, available for services across ${e} for families who want a longer, more formal procession.`,inCounty:!0,valuePoints:["The extended limousine hearse offers full-length casket display, suited to more formal services.","Matching family limousines can be booked alongside it to keep the whole procession visually consistent."],faq:{question:"What's the difference between a standard hearse and a limousine hearse?",answer:"A limousine hearse has a lengthened body giving full-length casket display and a more formal presence. A standard saloon hearse is more compact and suited to intimate services."}},{slug:"caskets-coffins-kenya",title:"Caskets & Coffins in Kenya",shortTitle:"Caskets & Coffins",summary:"Honour your loved one with a beautifully crafted casket or coffin that reflects a life well lived. We offer a carefully selected range of traditional coffins, premium hardwood caskets, and luxury imported designs, each chosen for its quality, elegance, and lasting tribute.",keywords:["Caskets Kenya","Coffins Kenya","Coffin Prices Kenya","Luxury Caskets","Wooden Coffins","Imported Caskets"],countyPageIntro:e=>`A range of locally sourced coffins and premium caskets, delivered and fitted for services anywhere in ${e}.`,inCounty:!0,valuePoints:["Coffins in a range of finishes from simple veneer to solid hardwood, sourced from Kenyan workshops and usually available within a day.","Caskets in rectangular, western-style finishes with upholstered interiors, including a mix of imported and locally finished options.","Everything arrives cleaned, assembled, and fitted, ready for the mortuary or service venue."],faq:{question:"What's the difference between a coffin and a casket?",answer:"A coffin is the traditional tapered, six-sided shape most common in Kenya. A casket is rectangular, usually with a hinged lid and upholstered interior, a western-style, often premium option. We stock both."}},{slug:"burial-services-kenya",title:"Burial Services in Kenya",shortTitle:"Burial Services",summary:"Graveside burial coordination handled with care and precision, from lowering equipment and grave preparation to a dignified, respectful committal for family and mourners.",keywords:["Burial Services Kenya","Grave Lowering Services","Graveside Funeral Kenya","Burial Coordination Kenya","Funeral Committal Kenya"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Graveside burial coordination for families in ${e}, including lowering equipment, grave preparation, and a dignified committal.`,inCounty:!1,valuePoints:["Professional lowering equipment and trained attendants handle the casket with care at the graveside.","Grave sites are prepared and dressed with artificial grass carpeting for a clean, respectful setting.","Coordinated alongside hearse transport, flowers, and the rest of the service as one plan."],faq:{question:"What does burial coordination include?",answer:"We arrange the lowering equipment, grave preparation, and graveside setup, coordinated with the cemetery or family land and timed around your service."}},{slug:"funeral-flowers-wreaths",title:"Funeral Flowers & Wreaths in Kenya",shortTitle:"Funeral Flowers",summary:"Flowers speak when words cannot. From handcrafted wreaths and casket sprays to personalised floral tributes, we help families express love, remembrance, and gratitude with beautiful arrangements delivered throughout Kenya.",keywords:["Funeral Flowers Kenya","Sympathy Flowers","Funeral Wreaths","Floral Tributes","Condolence Flowers"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Wreaths and tribute arrangements prepared to order and delivered to the mortuary or service venue anywhere in ${e}.`,inCounty:!0,valuePoints:["Casket sprays and standing wreaths from family, colleagues, or friend groups can all be arranged together.","Flowers are timed to arrive fresh, directly at the service venue."],faq:{question:"How far in advance should funeral flowers be ordered?",answer:"Same-day orders are usually possible, but ordering a day ahead gives us more flexibility on arrangement style and delivery timing."}},{slug:"funeral-planning-packages",title:"Funeral Planning & Packages",shortTitle:"Funeral Planning",summary:"Bundled packages covering transport, casket, and flowers together, plus guidance through the full funeral planning checklist.",keywords:["Funeral Planning Kenya","Funeral Packages Kenya","Funeral Arrangements Kenya","Funeral Costs Kenya"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Bundled funeral packages and planning support for families in ${e}, coordinating transport, casket, and flowers as a single plan.`,inCounty:!0,valuePoints:["One coordinator manages timing across transport, casket, and flowers so nothing is left to chance.","We give realistic cost guidance up front, before you commit to a package."],faq:{question:"What does a funeral package usually include?",answer:"Most families bundle transport, a casket or coffin, and flowers. Repatriation and additional services can be added if needed."}},{slug:"international-repatriation",title:"International Repatriation Services",shortTitle:"Repatriation",summary:"Every family deserves the comfort of knowing their loved one will reach home with dignity. We coordinate international repatriation, including documentation, embalming, embassy requirements, airline transportation, and customs clearance from start to finish.",keywords:["Body Repatriation Kenya","International Repatriation","Diaspora Funeral Services"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Airport-to-venue handling and documentation support for repatriations arriving into or departing from ${e}.`,inCounty:!1,valuePoints:["Bringing your loved one home to Kenya: airport collection, customs clearance, and onward transport to the family or service venue.","Sending your loved one home abroad: embalming, documentation, embassy requirements, and airline coordination for departure.","We help gather and coordinate the permits, embalming certificates, embassy paperwork, and airline requirements involved.","Customs clearance is handled on both ends of the journey, so the family isn't left navigating it alone."],faq:{question:"How long does international repatriation usually take to arrange?",answer:"It depends on the origin country's documentation process, but typically several days once embalming and permits are underway. We coordinate this closely with the family throughout."}},{slug:"cremation-services-kenya",title:"Cremation Services",shortTitle:"Cremation",summary:"Our professional cremation services in Kenya include collection of your loved one, crematorium booking, documentation, memorial ceremonies, ash collection, urn selection, and the local or international repatriation of cremated ashes.",keywords:["Cremation Services Kenya","Cremation Kenya","Cremation Nairobi"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Cremation coordination for families in ${e}, from collection through to crematorium booking and ash return.`,inCounty:!1,valuePoints:["Crematorium booking and coordination, timed around the family's chosen date.","Collection and transport handled alongside the rest of the funeral arrangements.","Ashes returned in a container of your choice, or arranged into a keepsake urn."],faq:{question:"Is cremation common in Kenya?",answer:"It's less traditional than burial but increasingly requested. We coordinate with licensed crematoria and handle the arrangements the same way we would a burial service."}},{slug:"exhumation-services-kenya",title:"Exhumation Services",shortTitle:"Exhumation",summary:"Licensed, respectful exhumation and reburial support, including the permits and paperwork required.",keywords:["Exhumation Services Kenya","Exhumation Kenya","Reburial Kenya"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Exhumation and reburial support for families in ${e}, including the permits required before work can begin.`,inCounty:!1,valuePoints:["We help gather the county and public health permits required before any exhumation can proceed.","Handled discreetly and respectfully, in line with legal and cultural requirements.","Coordinated reburial transport to the new site, whether locally or across counties."],faq:{question:"What permits are needed for an exhumation in Kenya?",answer:"Exhumation requires authorisation from the relevant county public health office, and sometimes a court order depending on the circumstances. We help families understand and gather what's needed for their specific case."}},{slug:"pet-cremation-kenya",title:"Individual Pet Cremation Service",shortTitle:"Pet Cremation",summary:"A straightforward, individual pet cremation service for families who want ashes returned quickly and with care. For burial, memorial keepsakes, and international pet repatriation, see our full Pet Memorial Services.",keywords:["Pet Cremation Nairobi","Individual Pet Cremation"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Individual pet cremation for families in ${e}, with collection and ash return handled with care.`,inCounty:!1,valuePoints:["Individual cremation, so the ashes you receive are your pet's alone.","Collection from your home or vet available.","Ashes returned in a simple container, or a keepsake urn if you'd prefer."],faq:{question:"How long does pet cremation take?",answer:"Usually a few days from collection to ash return. We confirm timing when you book, and can move faster if you need it."}},{slug:"funeral-accessories-kenya",title:"Funeral Accessories",shortTitle:"Accessories",summary:"Memorial keepsakes, urns, guest books, and other accessories to complete the service.",keywords:["Funeral Accessories Kenya","Memorial Keepsakes Kenya"],countyPageIntro:e=>`Memorial keepsakes and funeral accessories delivered to services across ${e}.`,inCounty:!1,valuePoints:["Urns and keepsake containers in a range of finishes, for cremation or memorial ashes.","Guest books and memorial cards for the service.","Ordered alongside any other service, or separately."],faq:{question:"How much notice do you need for funeral accessories?",answer:"Most items are available within a day or two. Let us know what you need and we'll confirm what's in stock and what needs ordering."}}];t.filter(e=>e.inCounty),e.s(["business",0,{name:"Perozie Funeral Services",shortName:"Perozie",tagline:"Comfort, Care & Compassion in Every Service",subTagline:"Funeral Services You Can Trust Across Kenya",phonePrimary:"+254 721 416 362",phoneSecondary:"+254 729 984 876",whatsapp:"254721416362",email:"info@hearse.co.ke",address:"Waiyaki Way, Muthiga, Nairobi",mapsUrl:"https://maps.google.com/?q=Waiyaki+Way+Muthiga+Nairobi",hours:"Available 24/7, all 47 counties"},"navLinks",0,[{label:"Fleet",href:"/services/hearse-services-in-kenya"},{label:"Services",href:"/services",children:[{label:"Hearse Services Kenya",href:"/services/hearse-services-in-kenya"},{label:"Luxury Limousine Hearse Services",href:"/services/limousine-hire-funeral"},{label:"Caskets & Coffins",href:"/services/caskets-coffins-kenya"},{label:"Burial Services",href:"/services/burial-services-kenya"},{label:"Funeral Flowers & Wreaths",href:"/services/funeral-flowers-wreaths"},{label:"Funeral Planning & Packages",href:"/services/funeral-planning-packages"},{label:"International Repatriation",href:"/services/international-repatriation"},{label:"Cremation Services",href:"/services/cremation-services-kenya"},{label:"Exhumation Services",href:"/services/exhumation-services-kenya"},{label:"Pet Cremation",href:"/services/pet-cremation-kenya"},{label:"Funeral Accessories",href:"/services/funeral-accessories-kenya"}]},{label:"Locations",href:"/locations",children:[{label:"Nairobi",href:"/locations/nairobi"},{label:"Mombasa",href:"/locations/mombasa"},{label:"Kisumu",href:"/locations/kisumu"},{label:"Nakuru",href:"/locations/nakuru"},{label:"All Counties",href:"/locations"}]},{label:"Contact",href:"/contact"}],"services",0,t])},18566,(e,t,r)=>{t.exports=e.r(76562)},57215,e=>{"use strict";var t=e.i(47167),r=e.i(71645),n=e.i(18566);function 